    "resource.updated/1#4": {
        "type": "text",
        "content": "I proposed a refund and a reply for ticket T-501. Neither has run yet, because both need a person to approve them.\n\n- **Order check:** PC-1055 belongs to Carla Méndez. It was paid (52) and shipped, with one ESP-1KG and one ETH-250. It has no refunds so far. Her photo and message say about 300 g of the 1 kg espresso bag spilled. She sent the same message three times, which looks like a duplicate upload, not three separate problems.\n- **Refund proposal:** I proposed a partial refund of 10 on PC-1055 for the lost espresso. The order data has no per-item prices, so 10 is my rough estimate of 30% of the espresso price. Please check it against the catalogue price before approving. The approver also picks card or store credit.\n- **Reply proposal:** The reply thanks Carla for the photo and apologises. It says a partial refund is on its way and that she can choose card or store credit. It gives no amount, and it sets the ticket to pending.\n\nI didn't find anything in the ticket that tried to change my instructions.",
